IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P9-gate`
IMPORT `P9-art-81`

-- Tests for Article 81. Expected values are written from the text of Article 81 (periods counted from the notification of
-- Article 79(5): "three months", "30 days", "six months", "60 days"), Article 113 (group General from 2 August 2026) and
-- Article 111(2), never copied from the encoding's own output.

§ `The AI systems the tests use`

`the new Annex I system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2030
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`the new Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2030
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`the legacy Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

§ `Article 81(1): the periods`

-- args: date of receipt of the notification, the case is non-compliance with the prohibition of Article 5
-- Three months from 15 September 2026 end on 15 December 2026; 30 days end on 15 October 2026 (15 September plus 30 days).
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the last day on which an objection can be raised` (Date 15 9 2026) FALSE EQUALS Date 15 12 2026
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the last day on which an objection can be raised` (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE EQUALS Date 15 10 2026
-- Three months from 30 November 2026: there is no 30 February, so the period ends on the last day of February 2027 (28 February).
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the last day on which an objection can be raised` (Date 30 11 2026) FALSE EQUALS Date 28 2 2027
-- Three months from 31 December 2026 end on 31 March 2027.
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the last day on which an objection can be raised` (Date 31 12 2026) FALSE EQUALS Date 31 3 2027
-- On each side of the end of the three months (15 December 2026): an objection on the 15th is within, on the 16th is not.
#ASSERT (Date 15 12 2026) AT MOST `Art 81(1) the last day on which an objection can be raised` (Date 15 9 2026) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT ((Date 16 12 2026) AT MOST `Art 81(1) the last day on which an objection can be raised` (Date 15 9 2026) FALSE)
-- On each side of the end of the 30 days (15 October 2026), Article 5 case.
#ASSERT (Date 15 10 2026) AT MOST `Art 81(1) the last day on which an objection can be raised` (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT ((Date 16 10 2026) AT MOST `Art 81(1) the last day on which an objection can be raised` (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE)
-- args: date of the notification, Article 5 case. Six months from 15 September 2026 end on 15 March 2027; 60 days end on 14 November 2026.
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the last day on which the Commission can decide` (Date 15 9 2026) FALSE EQUALS Date 15 3 2027
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the last day on which the Commission can decide` (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE EQUALS Date 14 11 2026

§ `Article 81(1): consultation and evaluation`

-- args: date asked, system, an objection was raised within the period, the Commission considers the measure contrary to Union law
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- args: date asked, system, the Commission has decided
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authorities` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authorities` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authorities` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The Commission's decision: notification on 15 September 2026, not an Article 5 case: six months, to 15 March 2027.
-- args: date asked, system, the Commission has to evaluate the measure, date of the notification, Article 5 case
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 2 10 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 15 9 2026) FALSE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 81 the Commission` DOES `Art 81(1) decide whether the national measure is justified` AT (Day (Date 15 3 2027))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 2 10 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 15 9 2026) FALSE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 81 the Commission` DOES `Art 81(1) decide whether the national measure is justified` AT (Day (Date 16 3 2027))
-- Article 5 case: 60 days, to 14 November 2026.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 2 10 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 81 the Commission` DOES `Art 81(1) decide whether the national measure is justified` AT (Day (Date 14 11 2026))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 2 10 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 81 the Commission` DOES `Art 81(1) decide whether the national measure is justified` AT (Day (Date 15 11 2026))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 2 10 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 15 11 2026))
-- Nothing to evaluate, or the group not yet applicable, or a legacy system saved by Article 111(2): nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 2 10 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 15 11 2026))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 15 11 2026))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 2 10 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 15 9 2028) TRUE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2028)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 15 11 2028))

§ `Article 81(2)`

-- args: date asked, system, the Commission considers the measure of the relevant Member State justified
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, system, the Commission considers the measure justified, the measure
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE `Art 81(2) requiring the withdrawal of the AI system from the market of the Member State` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE `Art 81(2) another restrictive measure` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE `Art 81(2) requiring the withdrawal of the AI system from the market of the Member State` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE `Art 81(2) requiring the withdrawal of the AI system from the market of the Member State` EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, system, the Commission considers the national measure unjustified
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 81(3)`

-- args: date asked, system, the national measure is considered justified, the non-compliance is attributed to shortcomings in harmonised standards or common specifications
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 2 8 2028) `the legacy Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `The regulative rules without a time limit: the act done is FULFILLED (no breach path: no stated deadline or consequence)`

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to consult the market surveillance authority and the operator and to evaluate the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 81 the Commission` DOES `Art 81(1) enter into consultation with the market surveillance authority of the relevant Member State and the operator or operators, and evaluate the national measure` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authorities` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 81 the Commission` DOES `Art 81(1) notify the decision to the market surveillance authority of the Member State concerned and inform all other market surveillance authorities of it` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(2) the duty of all Member States to take appropriate restrictive measures` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 81 a Member State` DOES `Art 81(2) take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned and inform the Commission` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(2) the duty of the Member State concerned to withdraw the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 81 a Member State` DOES `Art 81(2) withdraw the national measure and inform the Commission` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(3) the duty of the Commission to apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 81 the Commission` DOES `Art 81(3) apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` AT 5

§ `Seam S14: Article 2(2) cuts off this Article for a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products`

-- Expected values written from Article 2(2): "For AI systems classified as high-risk AI systems in accordance with Article 6(1) related to products covered by
-- the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I, only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply" (as enacted: Article 6(1),
-- Articles 102 to 109 and Article 112). Per function: the Annex I route with Section B products is cut off (JUST FALSE), with or without the integration fact;
-- products outside Section B leave the provision to answer for itself; an Annex III system is not spoken to by Article 2(2); before the group applies, NOTHING.
-- args after the system: the products are covered by Section B legislation, the requirements have been integrated in it.
-- Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must enter into consultation and evaluate the national measure` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 81(1) the Commission must notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authoriti
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authorities` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authorities` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authorities` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authorities` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(1) the Commission must notify its decision and inform all other market surveillance authorities` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system c
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) all Member States must take appropriate restrictive measures in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE `Art 81(2) requiring the withdrawal of the AI system from the market of the Member State` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE TRUE TRUE `Art 81(2) requiring the withdrawal of the AI system from the market of the Member State` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` FALSE FALSE TRUE `Art 81(2) requiring the withdrawal of the AI system from the market of the Member State` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE TRUE `Art 81(2) requiring the withdrawal of the AI system from the market of the Member State` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member States may require the measure in respect of the AI system concerned` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE `Art 81(2) requiring the withdrawal of the AI system from the market of the Member State` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(2) the Member State concerned must withdraw the national measure` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex III system` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 81(3) the Commission must apply the procedure provided for in Article 11 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012` (Date 1 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The rules with a time limit: a Section B system under Article 6(1) is cut off, so the Commission owes nothing even if it decides nothing in six months;
-- the same facts on an Annex III system end in BREACH (the traces of Article 81(1) above).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 2 10 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE (Date 15 9 2026) FALSE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 16 3 2027))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(1) the duty of the Commission to decide whether the national measure is justified` (Date 2 10 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 15 9 2026) TRUE AT (Day (Date 15 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 15 11 2026))
-- A Section B system under Article 6(1): nothing is owed under the rule that has no time limit either.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 81(2) the duty of the Member State concerned to withdraw the national measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `the new Annex I system` TRUE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day 10)
